{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":36,"alongside":40,"kin":45,"engines":70,"usedOn":71,"sites":72,"crewed":73,"museums":74,"hero":75},null,{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"specs":15,"links":18,"linked_missions":34,"tagline":13,"description":35},"lucy","Lucy","orbiter","NASA","USA","Lockheed Martin","2021-10-16","ACTIVE","2011-now","commercial-era","木星トロヤ群への最初のミッション","Added with /fly mission JSON (#341 batch 5).",{"length_m":16,"diameter_m":17},16,1.7,[19,23,27,30],{"l":20,"u":21,"t":22},"The Lucy Spacecraft — NASA (16 m tip to tip, arrays deployed)","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lucy/spacecraft/","core",{"l":24,"u":25,"t":26},"Lucy (spacecraft) — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucy_(spacecraft)","intro",{"l":28,"u":29,"t":22},"Lucy mission overview (NASA)","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lucy/",{"l":31,"u":32,"t":33},"Levison et al. (2021) — Lucy Mission to the Trojan Asteroids (Space Science Reviews)","https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11214-021-00845-4","deep",[3],"NASAの12年間の多重フライバイ・ミッションで、6個の木星トロヤ群小惑星系と2個の主帯小惑星を訪れます（衛星を含めて全11回の接近遭遇）。3回の地球スイングバイによって形成された単一軌道により、L4とL5の両方のトロヤ群を訪問します。1974年のAustralopithecus afarensis化石にちなんで命名されました。その化石自体はビートルズの楽曲にちなんで名付けられました。その含意は、化石が初期人類の歴史を保存しているのと同じように、トロヤ群が初期太陽系の物質を保存している、ということです。",[37],{"id":3,"name":4,"first":38,"year":39},"木星トロヤ群初の探査機；単一の12年軌道で8個の小惑星とその衛星を含む11個の天体を訪問――異なる太陽周回軌道上の天体数としては記録的",2021,[41],{"id":42,"name":43,"tagline":44},"atlas-v","Atlas V","United Launch Allianceの進化したAtlas",[46,50,54,58,62,66],{"id":47,"name":48,"tagline":49},"dart","DART","初の惑星防衛インパクター（ディモルフォス）",{"id":51,"name":52,"tagline":53},"psyche-spacecraft","Psyche","金属豊富なM型小惑星への初のミッション",{"id":55,"name":56,"tagline":57},"europa-clipper","Europa Clipper","エウロパの居住可能性の解明に専念する最初のミッション",{"id":59,"name":60,"tagline":61},"parker-solar-probe","Parker Solar Probe","太陽に最も接近した宇